#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Absolute path to the 32-byte key that encrypts stored BMC passwords. Create it yourself, outside the web root, readable only by the web server and poller user, in a directory that only root and that user can write; the plugin never creates or writes it. Back it up with the database: without it, stored passwords must be entered again."
msgstr "Ruta absoluta de la clave de 32 bytes que cifra las contraseñas BMC. Créela fuera de la raíz web, legible solo por el servidor web y el usuario del sondeador, en un directorio donde solo root y ese usuario puedan escribir. El complemento nunca la crea ni escribe. Respáldela con la base de datos: sin ella deberá volver a introducir las contraseñas."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Collector"
msgstr "Recopilador"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Collection Interval"
msgstr "Intervalo de recopilación"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Seconds between reads of each BMC."
msgstr "Segundos entre lecturas de cada BMC."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Rediscovery Interval"
msgstr "Intervalo de redescubrimiento"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Seconds between full resource discoveries of each BMC. A BMC is also rediscovered at once when a known resource disappears or changes type."
msgstr "Segundos entre descubrimientos completos de recursos de cada BMC. También se redescubre inmediatamente si un recurso conocido desaparece o cambia de tipo."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Collector Time Budget"
msgstr "Presupuesto de tiempo del recopilador"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Seconds one collector run may spend before it stops starting new BMCs. Keep it below the poller interval; unfinished BMCs resume on the next run."
msgstr "Segundos disponibles para una ejecución antes de dejar de iniciar BMC nuevos. Manténgalos por debajo del intervalo de sondeo; los BMC incompletos continúan en la próxima ejecución."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "BMCs read in parallel. Each BMC is read by one worker at a time."
msgstr "BMC leídos en paralelo. Cada BMC lo lee un solo proceso a la vez."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Collector Workers"
msgstr "Procesos del recopilador"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Connect Timeout"
msgstr "Tiempo de espera de conexión"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Seconds allowed for the TCP connection and TLS handshake to a BMC."
msgstr "Segundos permitidos para conectar por TCP y negociar TLS con un BMC."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Request Timeout"
msgstr "Tiempo de espera de solicitud"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Seconds allowed for one whole request to a BMC, including the connection."
msgstr "Segundos permitidos para una solicitud completa al BMC, incluida la conexión."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "KiB accepted in one BMC response body; a larger response is refused."
msgstr "KiB aceptados en el cuerpo de una respuesta BMC; se rechazan respuestas mayores."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Maximum Response Size"
msgstr "Tamaño máximo de respuesta"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Freshness"
msgstr "Actualidad"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Collection intervals after which a reading is shown as delayed."
msgstr "Intervalos de recopilación tras los cuales una lectura se muestra retrasada."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Delayed After"
msgstr "Marcar retrasado tras"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Collection intervals after which a reading is stale and reads as unknown. Always at least one more than Delayed After."
msgstr "Intervalos tras los que una lectura queda obsoleta y se lee como desconocida. Siempre al menos uno más que Marcar retrasado tras."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Stale After"
msgstr "Considerar obsoleto tras"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Uninstall"
msgstr "Desinstalar"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Keep Plugin Tables on Uninstall"
msgstr "Conservar tablas al desinstalar"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "When checked, uninstalling the plugin keeps its BMC registry, encrypted passwords, and reading cache. Clear it to have the uninstall drop them. This release creates no Cacti devices, and uninstall never touches devices, graphs, or BMCs."
msgstr "Si está marcado, se conservan el registro BMC, las contraseñas cifradas y la caché de lecturas al desinstalar. Desmárquelo para eliminarlos. Esta versión no crea dispositivos Cacti y la desinstalación nunca toca dispositivos, gráficos ni BMC."

#: lib/TlsMode.php
msgid "Verify against the system CA store"
msgstr "Verificar con el almacén CA del sistema"

#: lib/TlsMode.php
msgid "Verify against a CA bundle file"
msgstr "Verificar con un archivo de certificados CA"

#: lib/TlsMode.php
msgid "Pinned public key (SHA-256)"
msgstr "Clave pública fijada (SHA-256)"

#: lib/TlsMode.php
msgid "Do not verify (unsafe)"
msgstr "No verificar (inseguro)"

#: redfish_bmcs.php
msgid "You do not have access to the Cacti device of this BMC."
msgstr "No tiene acceso al dispositivo Cacti de este BMC."

#: redfish_bmcs.php
msgid "The BMC could not be saved."
msgstr "No se pudo guardar el BMC."

#: redfish_bmcs.php
msgid "The BMC was saved."
msgstr "Se guardó el BMC."

#: redfish_bmcs.php
msgid "The BMC and its cached data were deleted. Its Cacti device was left in place."
msgstr "Se eliminaron el BMC y su caché. Se conservó su dispositivo Cacti."

#: redfish_bmcs.php
msgid "Backoff and held failures were cleared; the collector reads the BMC on its next run."
msgstr "Se borraron la espera progresiva y los fallos retenidos; el recopilador leerá el BMC en la próxima ejecución."

#: redfish_bmcs.php
msgid "Adding devices and graphs needs Cacti's device management permission."
msgstr "Agregar dispositivos y gráficos requiere el permiso de gestión de dispositivos Cacti."

#: redfish_bmcs.php
msgid "The device of this BMC was deleted. Choose another device, or none, on the BMC form first."
msgstr "Se eliminó el dispositivo de este BMC. Elija primero otro dispositivo o ninguno en su formulario."

#: redfish_bmcs.php
#, php-format
msgid "The data queries were indexed again and %d graphs were added."
msgstr "Se reindexaron las consultas y se agregaron %d gráficos."

#: redfish_bmcs.php
msgid "The device was created with its Redfish graphs."
msgstr "Se creó el dispositivo con sus gráficos Redfish."

#: redfish_bmcs.php
msgid "Installing the Redfish templates needs Cacti's Import Templates permission."
msgstr "Instalar las plantillas Redfish requiere el permiso Importar plantillas de Cacti."

#: redfish_bmcs.php
msgid "The Redfish templates are installed."
msgstr "Las plantillas Redfish están instaladas."

#: redfish_bmcs.php
msgid "The Redfish templates could not be installed. The health page shows why."
msgstr "No se pudieron instalar las plantillas Redfish. La página de estado muestra el motivo."

#: redfish_bmcs.php
msgid "The import could not be saved; nothing was imported."
msgstr "No se pudo guardar la importación; no se importó nada."

#: redfish_bmcs.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d BMCs were imported."
msgstr "Se importaron %d BMC."

#: redfish_credentials.php
msgid "This credential is used by a BMC on a Cacti device you do not have access to, so it cannot be changed here."
msgstr "Esta credencial la usa un BMC de un dispositivo Cacti al que no tiene acceso, por lo que no puede cambiarse aquí."

#: redfish_credentials.php
msgid "Name: another credential already uses this name."
msgstr "Nombre: otra credencial ya usa este nombre."

#: redfish_credentials.php
msgid "User Name: enter 1 to 255 characters without control characters."
msgstr "Nombre de usuario: ingrese de 1 a 255 caracteres sin caracteres de control."

#: redfish_credentials.php
msgid "Password: enter the password of the BMC account."
msgstr "Contraseña: ingrese la contraseña de la cuenta BMC."

#: redfish_credentials.php
#, php-format
msgid "The credential was saved, but the password was not stored: %s"
msgstr "Se guardó la credencial, pero no la contraseña: %s"

#: redfish_credentials.php
msgid "The credential could not be saved."
msgstr "No se pudo guardar la credencial."

#: redfish_credentials.php
msgid "The credential was saved."
msgstr "Se guardó la credencial."

#: redfish_credentials.php
msgid "The credential and its stored password were deleted."
msgstr "Se eliminaron la credencial y su contraseña guardada."

#: redfish_credentials.php
msgid "The credential was not deleted. A credential in use by a BMC cannot be deleted."
msgstr "No se eliminó la credencial. No se puede eliminar una que esté usando un BMC."

#: redfish_operator.php
msgid "Retry collection"
msgstr "Reintentar recopilación"

#: redfish_operator.php
msgid "Monitoring view"
msgstr "Vista de supervisión"

#: redfish_operator.php
msgid "Observations could not be read. Ask an administrator to check the plugin log."
msgstr "No se pudieron leer las observaciones. Pida a un administrador que revise el registro del complemento."

